(1093, 1092, 168, 1, 1, 1049061, '1pb', '1st Paratroop Brigade', '1.Paratroop', NULL, 'shane21: Welcome to 1st Paratroop Brigade Command.\nDo you enjoy Airborne operations?Join the British 1st Airborne DIivision!Participate with large ops with major general Khbigjoe and squads working in the 1ABD!If you have any questions about what we do,want to know what squads are in the 1ABD,or would like info before you decide to join,email me at bebluekill@gmail.com! - General Bluekill ', '2007-08-10 12:27:55', '2019-08-06 13:12:12', 586, 586, 0, NULL, 1565097132, '1969-12-31 19:00:00', 'ukparint', 2, 'SYSTEM'),
(1094, 1092, 168, 1, 1, 1396714, '2pb', '2nd Paratroop Brigade', '2.Paratroop', NULL, 'zach: Welcome to 2nd Paratroop Brigade Command.\nThe British Army is always recruiting new officers to fill its ranks,and I offer training in any subject to squads and 1 to 1 training.Please see 1st Paratroop message of the day for more info on the British Army and joining it.\n\nGeneral Bluekill British Army Group CO.\n', '2007-08-10 12:28:19', '2019-08-06 13:12:12', 586, 586, 0, NULL, 1565097132, '1969-12-31 19:00:00', 'ukparint', 2, 'SYSTEM'),
